# reasoning as the two PDF exceptions above: this doc is meant to display for any
# reader who clones the repo, and a gitignored image can't do that - this is why
# its image references were silently broken from the start (found 2026-08-16).
!images/yad-malachi-berlin-title.png
!images/yad-malachi-berlin-klal-aleph.png
*.jpg
