# Engine OCR output and the comparison tables derived from it. ADDED 2026-09-01.
# Same class as vlm_extractions/ and sefaria_export/ above: machine output that
# a tool writes and another tool reads by path, never imported and never read by
# a test. Tracking them put ~7,100 lines of non-code into every diff, which is
# what pushed a code review over its size budget on 2026-09-01.
# Untracked with `git rm --cached`, so the working copies stay on disk and the
# blobs stay recoverable from history (they were added in b9aa810).
dicta_output/
ocr_engine_comparison*.json
/yad-malachi-berlin-sample_ocr.txt
/yad-malachi-rashi-sample_ocr.txt
tools/second_witness_eval/vlm_klal_8_22_ocr.txt
